Program Purpose
● This funding opportunity seeks to support applicants who can:
Develop, demonstrate and evaluate new, innovative traffic safety enforcement projects or
innovative enhancements to existing countermeasures that address risky driving behaviors.
● Focus areas for this project are:
○ Drug impaired driving;
○ Alcohol impaired driving;
○ Speeding;
○ Aggressive driving;
○ Occupant protection;
○ Distracted driving; and
○ Careless and negligent driving (especially around Work Zones, Commercial Motor
Vehicles, School Zones, and congested areas)
